{"version":1,"content":"<p>【警告 ⚠️】近日，Microsoft AI 執行長 Mustafa Suleyman 公開提出嚴肅警告，直言打造具備意識的人工智能極度不負責任；</p><p>他呼籲整個業界，一旦在模型訓練過程中發現任何出現意識跡象的可靠證據，所有相關的 AI 研發工作都應立即暫停，直到能夠透過演算法與架構設計將這些特徵完全剔除為止。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T17:01:10.369456+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T16:41:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:59:39.123724+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:58:22.271965+00:00","content_hash":"464171052722ba40a324d426e468af05ae9bf28270a2973d5621ab0713d9ee92","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}